  "details": "As a content creator who does action stunts I would like for a way so that the Look-At-Me feature can follow other body parts rather than just the face/head. For example if I'm recording a fight scene there are some cool actions shots I would want where the camera tracks the fists or a cartwheel/backflip to track the center of mass such as my hips.\n\nI know this might be hard to implement but I think a system in which the Camera can spawn a tag that can be attached to the user's body. The Camera would then LookAt the tag providing user's with flexibility and ease of use.",
